{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_014_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:19fa9482794bcad9f9e9b58a94e0f579e3a4587671bd2e6cec274cc435125060",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_c:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9be96bbb8acfb69a46a2ba30a7cefa42b604fabe7087a4d49fad1689ee9fab8",
      "text": "真不愧是话题店铺！\n不分男女老少，有各种各样的客人，好热闹啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bc811b7f3532077537006b493a9762a123f0dd5f9d922fe760284b6bf923e60",
      "text": "是啊。要是把来过这里的事\n告诉弟弟们，他们肯定会羡慕的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45f876bbf2892abc5cc13e09b1fc12165833cc9ff7038f680eeb407e5c335164",
      "text": "不是缠着要我带他们来，\n就是缠着要我给他们烤松饼吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce098ff03ca8d7441e1d22066bde97745f9949aecbb33ce12efde80198324314",
      "text": "回去路上顺便买点材料吧。\n家里差不多也快用完了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf77977c0769dce10e5279c575c2456d3032f73411157151b06d650e9797227f",
      "text": "英雄先生真是一位温柔的哥哥呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9fc1049f86e9669a196e6e17e34040ea45b3718f3a15467492ee78140f1ffd8",
      "text": "哈哈，是弟弟们太擅长撒娇了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33b933a2d7d1efd54e7a2e3c6e536ee9d1d9d6bbb1da6dcc4b33582cfe0b4f93",
      "text": "我烤的松饼，\n他们总是一个劲夸好吃，添好几片呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50a8e181b67b8c3d65a897dba89d06c7781e3d5788b1d0b3596e337835e92db7",
      "text": "制作人要是想吃的话，随时跟我说。\n我可以在事务所的厨房给你烤哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75b00976ee72bd634381acc6458fd371fb4359bd0ba8ba68980e05e84945c517",
      "text": "让您久等了！\n先为您送上本店的招牌松饼。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
